<!--
  alBaloo Studio — albaloostudio.com

  One URL, deliberately. This is a single-page site: /about, /releases,
  /whatwedo, /davan, /roxana, /podcast and /contact are anchor sections of
  index.html, not separate documents. Listing them as #fragments would be
  invalid in a sitemap, and inventing /about.html for pages that do not exist
  would put 404s in front of a crawler.

  Add a <url> here the day a real second page ships, not before.

  lastmod is the last commit that touched index.html, not the date this file
  was written — a lastmod that moves without the page changing is a lie the
  crawler learns to ignore.
-->
